# Flatten on the built-in flatten scenario: turtle 4 at (0, 0, 1) with a
# 5x4x3 hill of dirt in front of and around it and a chest on its left.

check flatten the 5x4x3 hill
  scenario flatten
  run flatten 5 4 3
  seconds 200
  until done:
  expect turtle 4 pos 0 0 1
  expect turtle 4 heading north
  expect blocks 0 0 1 4 3 3 air
  expect blocks 0 0 0 4 3 0 grass
  expect chest -1 0 1 item dirt = 59
  expect no-error
